abstract: >
  Reference implementation of the Distributed Edge-Based Vision Framework
  for Biodiversity Monitoring (DEBV-BM): Raspberry Pi 5 acquisition and
  quality-control, Tier-2 YOLOv11–BioCLIP–Grad-CAM++ inference, and
  closed-set fine-tuning for regional species inventories.
